# Cloudflare Pages clean-URL routing for Pinnacle Power Systems
#
#   pinnaclepowersystems.ug                 -> storefront (home.html)
#   pinnaclepowersystems.ug/admindashboard  -> admin console (admin.html)
#
# 200 = rewrite: serve that file while keeping the clean URL in the address bar.
# The admin page loads its scripts with RELATIVE paths (lib/..., admin/...), so it
# must be served at "/admindashboard" with NO trailing slash — that resolves the
# scripts from the domain root. The trailing-slash variant is 301'd to normalize.

/admindashboard/   /admindashboard   301
/admindashboard    /admin.html       200
/                  /home.html        200
